[trait] endurance
Always carries toughened.

[trait] blaze
Carries kindled.
In force only at or below 33% health.

[trait] heatproof
Refuses burn outright.

[trait] virulence
The effect of poison is 30% stronger.
The chance of inflicting poison is 20% higher.

[trait] venom_blood
Refuses poison outright.
Whatever damages it has a 4% chance of catching poison.

[trait] blood_thirst
Everything it does takes back 25% of the damage dealt.

[trait] last_gasp
Everything it does takes back 40% of the damage dealt.
In force only at or below 40% health.

[trait] reckless
Always carries unleashed.
Always carries bare.

[trait] thorns
Whatever damages it takes 8% of the struck unit's defence back.

[trait] swiftness
Always carries quickened.

[trait] ballast
Always carries fortified.
Always carries encumber.
Whatever damages it takes 5% of the struck unit's defence back.

[status] poison
At the holder's turn, each stack costs 50% of the applier's stat.
Over its 3 turns, one stack is 150%, and 450% at its cap.
Damages every turn · 3 turns · up to 3 stacks.

[status] burn
At the holder's turn, each stack costs 80% of the applier's stat.
Over its 2 turns, one stack is 160%, and 320% at its cap.
Damages every turn · 2 turns · up to 2 stacks.

[status] weaken
Lowers attack by 30% per stack.
At its cap that is 90%.
Lowers a stat · 3 turns · up to 3 stacks.

[status] expose
Lowers defence by 30% per stack.
At its cap that is 60%.
Lowers a stat · 2 turns · up to 2 stacks.

[status] blind
Lowers accuracy by 40% per stack.
At its cap that is 80%.
Lowers a stat · 2 turns · up to 2 stacks.

[status] mire
Lowers speed by 25% per stack.
At its cap that is 50%.
Lowers a stat · 2 turns · up to 2 stacks.

[status] bare
Lowers defence by 40%.
Lowers dodge by 40%.
Lowers a stat · always in force · 1 stack.

[status] encumber
Lowers speed by 10%.
Lowers a stat · always in force · 1 stack.

[status] stun
The holder loses its turn; cooldowns still tick, it just cannot act.
Costs a turn · 1 turn · 1 stack.

[status] fury
Raises attack by 30% per stack.
At its cap that is 90%.
Raises a stat · 3 turns · up to 3 stacks.

[status] haste
Raises speed by 30% per stack.
At its cap that is 60%.
Raises a stat · 3 turns · up to 2 stacks.

[status] focus
Raises accuracy by 40% per stack.
At its cap that is 80%.
Raises a stat · 3 turns · up to 2 stacks.

[status] toughened
Raises defence by 15%.
Raises a stat · always in force · 1 stack.

[status] veil
Raises dodge by 40% per stack.
At its cap that is 80%.
Raises a stat · 2 turns · up to 2 stacks.

[status] unleashed
Raises attack by 30%.
Raises a stat · always in force · 1 stack.

[status] kindled
Raises attack by 15%.
Raises a stat · always in force · 1 stack.

[status] fortified
Raises defence by 25%.
Raises a stat · always in force · 1 stack.

[status] quickened
Raises speed by 8%.
Raises a stat · always in force · 1 stack.

[status] block
Each stack swallows one strike whole; a two-strike skill spends two.
Blocks one strike · 2 turns · up to 3 stacks.

[status] regrowth
At the holder's turn, each stack restores 40% of the applier's stat.
Over its 3 turns, one stack is 120%, and 360% at its cap.
Restores every turn · 3 turns · up to 3 stacks.

[status] taunting
Every enemy that can attack at all must aim at the holder, at any range.
Costs a choice of target · 2 turns · 1 stack.

[element] neutral
Inert: it beats nothing and nothing beats it; every trade is 100%.

[element] water
Strong against fire and metal: an attack of this element deals 150%.
Weak to ground and electric: an attack of theirs deals 67% to it.

